d to the stars. Begin your quest, meet companions, and learn to harness the power of the stars on your journey to save Aethera from a fanatic zealot, hell-bent on plunging the Universe into darkness. Only then, can you truly fulfill your destiny.", "summary": "Gravastar is a sci-fi fantasy JRPG (Japanese-style Role Playing Game) for PC and consoles that combines a traditional JRPG aesthetic with a unique and fast-paced, turn-based battle system inspired by 2D arcade fighting games. The battle system in Gravastar is set apart from traditional turn-based JRPGs by its real-time button-combo input system. Alter the flow of battle, master your character's movesets, build enormous combos, and string together chains to dispatch your foes.", "themes": [{"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/gravastar", "videos": [{"id": 31120, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "TPrAM_eAfgY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TPrAM_eAfgY", "title": "Gravastar Trailer Theme Recording Session", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TPrAM_eAfgY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 31121, "name": "Gameplay video", "video_id": "KUvf7yrVHJU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KUvf7yrVHJU", "title": "Gravastar Demo Gameplay (6/9/18)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KUvf7yrVHJU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 185238, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "wLg2hr6KajQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wLg2hr6KajQ", "title": "Gravastar - Announce Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wLg2hr6KajQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}